  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: </p><p>Founded in 2013, INNOVV has been committed to redefining the motorcycle riding experience through smart technology. As a brand focused on motorcycle electronics, we develop products that combine safety, convenience, and innovation, helping riders stay connected, protected, and in control on every journey.</p><p>From dashcams and smart riding displays to navigation and safety solutions, every INNOVV product is designed with real-world riding in mind. We believe great technology should be practical, dependable, and seamlessly integrated into the motorcycle lifestyle.</p><p>For over a decade, INNOVV has continued to serve riders worldwide with products built for performance, trust, and everyday adventure.</p><p><br>• What makes us different:</p><p>Here is what makes INNOVV different:</p><ul><li>A specialized motorcycle niche, not general electronics</li><li>Products built around real rider needs and real-world use</li><li>A strong fit for content in touring, safety, tech, and motorcycle lifestyle</li><li>A trusted brand with over a decade of market presence</li><li>An 8% affiliate commission for every qualified sale</li></ul><p>INNOVV gives affiliates the opportunity to promote premium motorcycle technology to a focused audience with clear purchase intent.</p><p><br>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p>Commissions can be earned by using either an assigned discount code or a publicly available one from our official website, as long as the purchase is tracked through your unique affiliate link.</p><p><br>• How to promote us: </p><p>Free to promote using any method you are comfortable with—we don’t restrict the way you market our products, as long as all promotion is conducted ethically and legally.</p></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-6px;top:1096px;\"><div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"><br></div></div></div>",
